OL,3,ATwo in court over alleged Iran-linked
OL,4,Aplot at RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals have appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt in connection to an alleged
OL,8,FIran-linked plot at RAF Fairford last
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FMohmed Abdulkarim, 24, from
OL,12,FWestminster, London, has been charged
OL,13,Fwith assisting a foreign intelligence
OL,14,Fservice, which police earlier said they
OL,15,Fbelieved to be Iran.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
