OL,3,AHigh voter turnout for Israel election
OL,4,Awith less than two hours until polls
OL,5,Adue to close
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's been very high turnout in
OL,8,FIsrael's pivotal general election, with
OL,9,Fvoting due to continue for another two
OL,10,Fhours
OL,12,FPolls are due to close at 22:00 local
OL,13,Ftime (20:00 GMT) - but those already in
OL,14,Fline will still be able to vote
OL,16,FIt is Israel's first legislative
OL,17,Felection since the Hamas-led attacks on
OL,18,F7 October 2023. All 120 seats in the
OL,19,FKnesset, Israel's parliament, are up
OL,20,Ffor grabs
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
